## Model card

- **Name:** Kimi K3
- **Short description:** Moonshot AI's deprecated open-weights MoE reasoning model (2.8T total / 104B active parameters) with a 1M-token context window; superseded by Kimi K3.1 Pro.
- **Provider / access:** Moonshot AI API (`kimi-k3`), Hugging Face (`moonshotai/Kimi-K3`), and 14 API providers tracked on Artificial Analysis.
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026-07-16 release; deprecated on Artificial Analysis in favor of Kimi K3.1 Pro.
- **IDs:** `kimi/kimi-k3` (no Free ID on OpenCode Zen)
- **Context window:** 1M tokens input, verified via Artificial Analysis.
- **Modalities:** Text and image input; text output; reasoning enabled.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-13):** $3.00 / 1M input tokens, $15.00 / 1M output tokens (90% cache discount; $2.31/1M blended 7:2:1).
- **Architecture:** Mixture of Experts (MoE), 2.8T total / 104B active parameters; open weights under Kimi K3 License (commercial use with restrictions).

